  "ruleText": "Tre 102.02 Telephone Number of the Treasury. The treasury's telephone number is (603) 271-2621, Fax number is (603) 271-3922.\n\nSource. #3119, eff 9-23-85, EXPIRED: 9-23-91\n\nNew. #7588, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9574, eff 10-22-09",
